note branches and loops
n is 7
if n is greater than 10 then
    show "big"
otherwise if n is greater than 5 then
    show "medium"
otherwise
    show "small"
total is 0
repeat 5 times
    total is total + 1
show total
i is 0
repeat while i is less than 3
    i is i + 1
show i
for each item in [10, 20, 30]
    show item
total is 0
repeat 10 times
    total is total + 1
    if total is 3 then
        skip
    if total is 6 then
        stop
    show total
